Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?security:=20a=20certificate=20error=20is=20not?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20TLS=20intolerance=20=E2=80=94=20no=20version=20fallback=20on?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20it?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
